7. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL — NOT COVERED BY THE ABOVE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sections 2 and 4 cover the Rightsholder's own original material only. This
repository also vendors third-party material under `data/anchors/`, which is NOT
covered by them and remains subject to the terms of its own originators. It is
catalogued, with sources and checksums, in `data/anchors/MANIFEST.md`, and
includes without limitation:

  - OpenStreetMap extracts (`*_places.geojson`, `*_roads.geojson`,
    `osm_*_raw.json`) — (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, made available under the
    Open Database Licence (ODbL) v1.0. Used under that licence; nothing here
    relicenses them or purports to restrict rights the ODbL grants.
  - Census and municipal tables from data.opencity.in and the Pune Municipal
    Corporation, published as public-domain open data.
  - A GTFS extract obtained from a third-party repository.
  - `gadgil_poona_survey_part1.pdf` — D. R. Gadgil, "Poona: A Socio-Economic
    Survey, Part I — Economic", a scan from the Internet Archive's Digital
    Library of India collection, reproduced here for reference. The Rightsholder
    claims no copyright in it and asserts no rights over it.

Nothing in this file grants, restricts or otherwise affects any right in that
third-party material.

